{"ticker":{"symbol":"357780.KQ","name":"솔브레인","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":285500.0,"change_pct":-0.005226480836236891,"market_cap":2174931304448.0,"pe":10.748319,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.008231173380035026,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":530000.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Chemicals","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":1069,"website":"https://www.soulbrain.co.kr","business_summary":"Soulbrain Co., Ltd. develops, manufactures, and supplies various high tech industry core materials. It provides semiconductor materials, including CVD/ALD materials, etchant and cleaning agents, CMP slurries, and plating agents, as well as hydrofluoric acid/buffered oxide etchants for etching and cleaning of semiconductor oxide films. The company also offers functional chemical materials used in the manufacture of LCD and OLED panels, as well as components of panels, including thin glass and cell scribings. In addition, it provides electronic materials for the generation of eco-friendly energy, such as LED process materials, solar cells, and electric vehicle electronic materials; and lithium ion battery electrolyte and secondary battery electrodes. The company is headquartered in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"주식회사 솔브레인은 다양한 첨단산업 핵심소재를 개발, 제조, 공급하고 있습니다. CVD/ALD 재료, 식각액 및 세정제, CMP 슬러리, 도금제 등의 반도체 소재와 반도체 산화막 식각 및 세정용 불산/완충산화물 식각액을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 LCD 및 OLED 패널 제조에 사용되는 기능성 화학 소재뿐만 아니라 얇은 유리 및 셀 스크라이빙을 포함한 패널 구성 요소도 제공합니다. 또한, LED 공정재료, 태양전지, 전기차 전자재료 등 친환경 에너지 생산을 위한 전자재료를 제공하고 있습니다. 리튬이온전지 전해액, 이차전지 전극 등을 포함한다. 회사는 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":1246115940000.0,"rev_lo":1239900000000.0,"rev_hi":1255300000000.0,"rev_g":0.3495,"n":7,"eps":23707.826,"eps_lo":22532.0,"eps_hi":25121.865,"eps_g":1.3051},{"period":"2027","rev":1383842780000.0,"rev_lo":1208385860000.0,"rev_hi":1547800000000.0,"rev_g":0.1105,"n":12,"eps":26562.293,"eps_lo":20615.0,"eps_hi":29229.742,"eps_g":